<title>UK: Brazil's BICBANCO to set $50 mln 8-yr bond, put - ANZ.</title>
<headline>Brazil's BICBANCO to set $50 mln 8-yr bond, put - ANZ.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Banco Industrial e Commercial SA (BICBANCO) has mandated ANZ Investment bank to arrange a Euro Medium Term Note (MTN) programme and lead manage the first issue, ANZ said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The programme is expected to be signed by the end of June and will provide for an issuance of up to $200 million.</p>
<p>BICBANCO is expected to launch a $50 million eight-year fixed rate Eurobond with a three-year put in the next few weeks, ANZ said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
